    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Category:</strong> General feat</p><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Strength 15, Bash, Power Attack, base attack bonus +4.</p><p><strong>Summary:</strong> Once per day, a declared melee hit erupts as a thunderclap centered on the target.</p><p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per day, before making a normal melee attack, declare Thunderous Blow. If the attack hits, produce a thunderclap effect centered on the target, using your character level as caster level and save DC 10 + half your character level + your Charisma modifier. A miss still expends the daily use.</p><p><strong>Special:</strong> You may select this feat more than once; each additional selection grants one more use per day.</p><p><strong>Warrior bonus feat:</strong> Yes</p><p><strong>Foundry and GM handling:</strong> Declare and expend the use before rolling, then resolve the thunderclap spell&#39;s area, save, and effects manually.</p>"
    },
